      "id": "S3",
      "status": "pass",
      "analysis": "The 21 inherited source modules were read in full together with their direct declarations, not accepted merely from old coverage. SheafOrbitQuotient constructs the sectionwise orbit presheaf and actual sheafification, with local epimorphism, covering-sieve orbit kernel, universal invariant lift, uniqueness and natural Hom equivalence. The universe lift retains all natural transformations and allows Set_V values. SheafFibreProducts constructs actual sectionwise fibre products and proves the sheaf property. The comparison from E to H times_Q (E/Gamma) is always locally surjective using only local lifts and locally chosen group corrections; all-test stabilizer triviality is equivalent to its being an isomorphism and to existence of a realization. SheafQuotientRecovery, SheafDescentMorphisms and SheafDescentEquivalence prove recovery of every D, a full morphism bijection, functoriality and the genuine category equivalence; uniqueness of a marked realization does not assert its automorphisms are trivial. SheafBaseChange and SheafBaseQuotient treat arbitrary sheaves B and identify the quotient of H times_Q B with B, give the category classification over B, actual rearrangement isomorphisms and naturality for all maps in both variables. ProfiniteDescent and ProfiniteOrbitLocal identify the chosen coherent topology with exactly finite jointly surjective covers and the actual profinite probe sheaf. No finite/free action assumption, global representative, representability of B or point-only replacement is introduced.",
